      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030407,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 7,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "老师，我觉得刚才绯花里的表演其实相当不错，/n到底哪里有那么大的问题？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304070070",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030407008,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030407,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 8,
      "SpeakerName": "演出负责人",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "哪里？全部。/n说到底，过去的银河座从没采用过那种演出。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304070080",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030407009,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030407,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 9,
      "SpeakerName": "演出负责人",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "你们没有看《桥弁庆》的资料吗？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304070090",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030407010,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030407,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 10,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不，并不是……。/n可是演员不同，演出方式多少也会发生变化——",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304070100",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 400,
          "HeadMotionMasterId": 2,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030407011,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030407,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 11,
      "SpeakerName": "演出负责人",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我就是在说这种想法错了。银河座有银河座的方式。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304070110",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030407012,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030407,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 12,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "或许是这样……但好的舞台，/n不也应该根据演员的个性，加入灵活的演出吗。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304070120",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 107,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 14,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030407013,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030407,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 13,
      "SpeakerName": "演出负责人",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "沃尔芙，你是在对我们的做法指手画脚吗？/n这次《桥弁庆》的公演，关系着银河座今后的未来。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304070130",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030407014,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030407,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 14,
      "SpeakerName": "演出负责人",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "你难道有背负今后银河座的觉悟吗？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304070140",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030407015,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030407,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 15,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "！不……是啊，看来是我越界了。/n抱歉，耽误时间。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304070150",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 400,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030407016,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030407,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 16,
      "SpeakerName": "演出负责人",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……好，1分钟后重新开始排练！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304070160",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030407017,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030407,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 17,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座劇団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "是！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304070170",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030407018,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030407,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 18,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 1,
      "BgmFileName": "204",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.20000000298023224,
