      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030407,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 36,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座团员们",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "喂，你们不觉得最近，/n老师老是只把千寿历前辈单独叫走吗？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304070350",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030407037,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030407,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 37,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座团员们",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我也这么觉得。到底有什么事？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304070360",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030407038,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030407,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 38,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座团员们",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不知道，不过这也不是今天才开始的吧？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304070370",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030407039,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030407,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 39,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座团员们",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "可是啊，刚才负责大道具的孩子也被老师叫过去了……。/n他们对弁庆的服装提出了特别细的要求。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304070380",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030407040,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030407,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 40,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座团员们",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "什么“这里不够好”“这里要这样改”之类的。/n对牛若丸的衣服却没说那么多……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304070390",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030407041,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030407,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 41,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座团员们",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "总觉得，他们是不是在刻意衬托千寿历前辈？/n当然，我承认她的演技确实比其他演员厉害……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304070400",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
